Instructions for AI coding agents working on this repository live in `.agent/`.

Start with `.agent/README.md`, which indexes the rest:

- `.agent/project.md` — architecture and invariants
- `.agent/verified-facts.md` — **read before touching anything model-related**
- `.agent/conventions.md` — build, lint, and how work is verified here
- `.agent/status.md` — what is done, verified, and untested
- `.agent/roadmap/` — planned work

They are kept in one place so the guidance does not drift between tools.
